  "description": "Headlights are fundamental to driving and they are a part of the safety circle that actually helps prevent accidents. When getting close to the end of their lives, headlamps shine less brightly, it's quite distracting if one of your headlamps is brighter than the other, and it certainly won't reflect road markings and traffic signs very well. YITAMOTOR high-quality headlights will let all of the light through, allowing your headlights to work the way they were originally made to.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/2500/3500/1500 HD/2500 HD Pickup\n2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic Body Pickup Only\n2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Compatible with 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD / 2500 HD / 3500; 2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic; 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding); High Beam Bulb Type: HB3/9005; Low Beam Bulb Type: HB4/9006; Bulbs and wiring harness are not included\nWaterproofness: The fully sealed structure with solid silicon prevents moisture from being trapped inside the housing, it can also provide reliable services under various harsh weather conditions, such as rainy days, snowy days, or sandstorms\nImpact-resistant and Sturdy: Made from durable polycarbonate lenses, it effectively protects against damage caused by road debris and impacts from branches on mountain trails, its high-strength housing also better withstands shocks and vibrations during off-road adventures\nImproved Lighting Effects: The integrated metalized reflectors of this headlight assembly increase light distance for better visibility & driving safety in any dusky conditions\nDirect Replacement: Highly recommended professional installer for Installation, one pair of passenger and driver side headlights",
